From 5ca7d24b3d48acd6d8752e24444a9b3596752e3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 23:32:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] cri: cache immutable image supplemental groups

Resolve image-defined supplemental groups through a temporary view of the committed image ChainID and cache successful results in a bounded LRU. Keep container-specific primary and explicit groups outside the cached value while coalescing concurrent misses without blocking cancellation.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

Copilot-Session: 925784b1-44a7-4d56-b04f-e527d2e0879f
